WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.985
A coworker shows Alex a faster way

2
00:00:01.985 --> 00:00:03.762
to get through part of the job.

3
00:00:03.762 --> 00:00:05.596
The explanation is simple:

4
00:00:05.596 --> 00:00:09.021
it saves time, and supposedly everyone does it.

5
00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:12.133
Shortcuts can look harmless in the moment, especially when

6
00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.942
they come from someone who seems more experienced.

7
00:00:14.942 --> 00:00:17.821
But sometimes the real issue is not speed.

8
00:00:17.821 --> 00:00:21.734
It is safety, quality, trust, and judgment.
